<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Camco upped to recommend.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Camco upped to recommend.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sach raised its rating on Camco International Inc to recommended from market perform, according to a Goldman Sachs source.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/4 to 44-3/8 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
